  "ingredients": [
    "12 thick slices white bread, cut into 1 inch cubes",
    "2 cups shredded Cheddar cheese",
    "1.5 cups chopped fresh mushrooms",
    "0.25 cup crumbled cooked bacon",
    "12 eggs",
    "2.5 cups half-and-half",
    "1 teaspoon Dijon mustard"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_km8tBg9MzTZRZPHGYDguE4-UfY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-132372-bacon-egg-and-cheese-strata-VAT-step-01-0e0a5e1d9f6b4dff8338fa0515718804.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/132372/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss cubed bread, cheese, mushrooms, and bacon together in a large bowl; pour into a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Cl7uoH2zL2QdTiLeq8bH65D4Jsg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-132372-bacon-egg-and-cheese-strata-VAT-step-02-fda5b3fb7e6d435ba3426a65fd61f9df.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/132372/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk eggs, half-and-half, and mustard together until smooth; pour evenly over bread mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3eVGnGhdir8pR4v19dNljjvB8nM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-132372-bacon-egg-and-cheese-strata-VAT-step-03-b041549121bc48a09c6d21ffb22a9a47.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/132372/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can bake the strata straightaway but for better results, cover the dish with plastic wrap and refrigerate overnight. When ready to bake, preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/a8g58bHqHMVLwLnYhMfwHS-hvFM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-132372-bacon-egg-and-cheese-strata-VAT-step-04-8b9eeffba5b54825bf11df8ef1d896c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/132372/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove plastic wrap from the baking dish; bake strata in the preheated oven until eggs are set and top is golden brown, about 1 hour. Let stand for 10 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5YISaUjwe0nMKBMFFkIdwKrFibg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-132372-bacon-egg-and-cheese-strata-VAT-step-05-d570e6c89abd4dbf96ad6fdeb3f0a6e3.jpg"
      ],
